  "signatureHoleDescription": "Hole 8 is the longest at Kentwood at 288 feet — still a par 3, still friendly, but the one hole where you can actually air out a midrange. It's the perfect taste of what makes this course great: short, social golf with just enough challenge to keep you coming back.",

  "localTips": "Raleigh's busiest course — weekday mornings are the quiet window. There are two extra practice baskets for putting warm-ups. Free to play, all par 3s, and a putter plus a midrange is the whole bag you need.",

